    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93164" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαλπ-ιγκτής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>trumpeter</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.69
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.3.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ascl.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				2.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.3
			</span></i>, etc.; this spelling has the best M<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i> authority and occurs in <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.299
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, but has not been found in 
				Att.
			 Inscrr.; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαλπικτής</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				153.68
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				3.1288
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				519.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc.; 
				Boeot.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαλπικτάς</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.1773
			</span></i> (Thespiae, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>), <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαλπιγκτάς</span></b>  ib.<i><span class="en">
				3195
			</span></i> (Orchom., <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>); later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαλπιστής</span></b> , ib.<i><span class="en">
				9(2).525.4
			</span></i> (Thessaly, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				3.1285
			</span></i> (Attica, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				7.3196
			</span></i> (Orchom. 
				Boeot.
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				4591.3
			</span></i>, etc.; also in <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.45.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				4.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Apoc.</u>
				18.22
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
